{"archivedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00Z","archivedInDashboard":false,"attachedStylesheets":[],"authorName":"Shawn Peterson","categoryId":1,"contentTypeCategory":4,"createdAt":"2026-06-30T18:12:30.787Z","createdById":"26261533","currentState":"DRAFT","domain":"info.davincilabs.com","featuredImage":"","featuredImageAltText":"","htmlTitle":"Our Vermont Manufacturing Facility | DaVinci Private Label","id":"216194811691","language":"en","layoutSections":{},"metaDescription":"Where your private label products are manufactured. Williston, Vermont since 1976. FDA-registered, GMP certified. Multi-format production lines on site.","name":"Private Label - Page - Our Facility","pageRedirected":false,"publicAccessRules":[],"publicAccessRulesEnabled":false,"publishDate":"1970-01-01T00:00:00Z","published":false,"slug":"pl-demo-facility","state":"DRAFT","subcategory":"site_page","templatePath":"Private Label/Templates/Page.html","translations":{},"updatedAt":"2026-08-07T19:42:23.355Z","updatedById":"26261533","url":"https://info.davincilabs.com/pl-demo-facility","useFeaturedImage":false,"widgetContainers":{"main_content":{"widgets":[{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(rgba(201,219,226,.85), rgba(201,219,226,.85)), url('https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_HeroBackground_2.jpg') center/cover; padding: 90px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">QUALITY</p>\n    <h1 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 48px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.15; margin: 0 0 22px;\">Where your private label products are manufactured.</h1>\n    <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 34px;\">Our facility in Williston, Vermont has been making dietary supplements since 1976. FDA-registered, GMP certified, and built for both small-batch private label runs and large-scale production.</p>\n    <a href=\"#get-started\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #6BA644; color: white; padding: 16px 38px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: .5px;\">Schedule a Consultation</a>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201608870,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"max-width: 850px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 80px 20px 50px;\">\n  <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 26px;\">Vermont manufacturing built for serious supplement brands.</h2>\n  <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">[PLACEHOLDER FOR JUSTIN/PATRICK: Insert facility detail content. Square footage, production capacity, format-specific equipment, quality lab description, warehouse and fulfillment capacity. Photos from facility tour would significantly enhance this page.]</p><p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">Our 929 Harvest Lane facility houses production lines for capsules, tablets, powders, softgels, chewables, liquids, and oral sprays. On-site quality laboratory. Climate-controlled raw material warehousing. Finished goods inventory for ready-to-ship private label SKUs.</p>\n</div>"},"id":216201608871,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: white; padding: 80px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 16px;\">What's inside our Vermont facility</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 17px; text-align: center; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto 48px;\">Production lines for every supplement format, on-site quality lab, and warehousing built for both small-batch and large-volume runs.</p>\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 24px;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; padding: 32px 26px; border-radius: 8px; border-top: 4px solid #012638;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 56px; height: 56px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 12px; margin: 0 0 18px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M21 7.5 12 12m0 0L3 7.5M12 12v9.75m0-9.75 9-4.5M3 7.5l9 4.5M3 7.5v9l9 4.5m9-13.5v9L12 21.75\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0; line-height: 1;\">7</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 12px 0 14px;\">supplement formats</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;\">Capsules, tablets, powders, softgels, chewables, liquids, and oral sprays. One facility, every format your brand needs.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; padding: 32px 26px; border-radius: 8px; border-top: 4px solid #012638;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 56px; height: 56px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 12px; margin: 0 0 18px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M9.75 3.1v5.66m4.5-5.66v5.66m-4.5 0a3.38 3.38 0 0 1-1.5 6.43m6-6.43a3.38 3.38 0 0 0 1.5 6.43M4.5 19.5a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 4.5 4.5h6a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 4.5-4.5v-4.31a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-4.5-4.5h-6a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-4.5 4.5v4.31Z\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0; line-height: 1;\">100%</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 12px 0 14px;\">on-site QC</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;\">Identity testing, potency verification, contaminant screening at every production stage.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; padding: 32px 26px; border-radius: 8px; border-top: 4px solid #012638;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 56px; height: 56px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 12px; margin: 0 0 18px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12c0 5.31-3.69 9.76-8.65 10.95a.84.84 0 0 1-.4.05.94.94 0 0 1-.41-.05A11.25 11.25 0 0 1 3 12V5.99c0-.46.31-.87.74-1.05A23.95 23.95 0 0 1 12 3a23.95 23.95 0 0 1 8.26 1.94c.43.18.74.59.74 1.05V12Z\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0; line-height: 1;\">FDA</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 12px 0 14px;\">registered facility</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;\">FDA-registered, GMP certified to SQF and NSF GMP 455-2 standards. Climate-controlled storage.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; padding: 32px 26px; border-radius: 8px; border-top: 4px solid #012638;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 56px; height: 56px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 12px; margin: 0 0 18px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M4.26 10.15a23.93 23.93 0 0 1 14.66-.36c.41.12.69.5.69.93v6.91a2.62 2.62 0 0 1-1.55 2.39 23.94 23.94 0 0 0-12.94 0 2.62 2.62 0 0 1-1.55-2.39v-6.92c0-.42.27-.8.69-.93Z\"/><path d=\"M4.26 10.15A23.93 23.93 0 0 1 12 9c1.05 0 2.08.1 3.07.31M4.26 10.15c-.85.46-1.7.98-2.51 1.55a25 25 0 0 0 10.25 5.32\"/><path d=\"M18.75 11.25v-2.4l3-1.62-7.5-4.23-7.5 4.23 3 1.62v2.4\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0; line-height: 1;\">50+</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 12px 0 14px;\">years experience</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;\">DaVinci has been manufacturing supplements in Vermont since 1976. Decades of formulation expertise.</p>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201608872,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div id=\"get-started\" style=\"background: #e6e5e3; padding: 80px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Ready to launch your private label supplement line?</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 32px;\">Schedule a consultation. We will walk through your audience, the right formulations for them, branding options, and the timeline.</p>\n    <a href=\"#get-started\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #6BA644; color: white; padding: 16px 40px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: .5px;\">Schedule a Consultation</a>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201608873,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{},"id":218949791247,"label":"PL - Global Guide Offer","module_id":218944099153,"order":4,"type":"module"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #e6e5e3; padding: 90px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">50+ YEARS OF SUPPLEMENT MANUFACTURING</p>\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 34px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 24px;\">Developed by us. Made for you.</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">With over 50 years in the health supplement industry, we are one of the most trusted dietary supplement manufacturers. Every private label supplement we produce is doctor-formulated using thoroughly researched ingredients, then scientifically reviewed for efficacy and quality before it ever enters production in our U.S. facilities.</p>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">FoodScience is an FDA-registered food facility, GMP certified to SQF food safety standards, and certified to NSF GMP 455-2.</p>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 40px;\">When you partner with us, our expert team is with you every step of the way. Help your customers find what they want from a source they trust. You.</p>\n    <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 50px; justify-content: center; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n      <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_Logo_SQF.png\" alt=\"SQF Certified\" style=\"height: 80px; width: auto;\"/>\n      <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/NSF.png\" alt=\"NSF GMP Certified\" style=\"height: 80px; width: auto;\"/>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201608875,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 80px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Frequently asked questions</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 17px; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 44px;\">None</p>\n    <details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>Where is your manufacturing facility?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Williston, Vermont. We have operated from Vermont since 1976 and have been steadily expanding the facility over the past five decades to add manufacturing lines, quality lab, and warehousing capacity.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>What formats do you manufacture on-site?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Capsules (vegetarian and gelatin), tablets, soft gels, powders, chewables, liquids, gummies, and oral sprays. Most formats run on dedicated lines so cross-contamination risk is minimized. Some specialty formats use shared lines with rigorous cleaning protocols between runs.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>What is your production capacity?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">We produce millions of bottles annually across all formats. We can scale production for high-volume programs while maintaining quality. For very high-volume orders (mid-six-figures and up), we plan production scheduling with you in advance to ensure capacity.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>Do you store finished goods inventory for clients?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Yes. We can hold finished goods inventory in our climate-controlled warehouse for ongoing fulfillment programs. Storage fees apply for extended holds. Most clients have us produce inventory in larger production runs and ship to their own fulfillment partner.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>Can I tour the facility?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Yes. We host facility tours for prospective and active clients. Tours typically include the manufacturing floor, quality lab, and warehouse. Schedule a tour through your account manager. Tours are most valuable once you have a specific program scoped because we can show you the lines that will produce your products.</div>\n    </details>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201608876,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{},"id":218950032790,"label":"PL - Global FDA Disclaimer","module_id":218942529652,"order":7,"type":"module"}]}},"widgets":{}}